# ==============================================================================
# DigiBuddy4U - Root Environment Guide
# ==============================================================================
# The DigiBuddy4U project is structured into three distinct sub-applications:
#
# 1. /client  - React + Vite + Tailwind CSS public customer-facing website
# 2. /admin   - React + Vite + Tailwind CSS admin management dashboard
# 3. /server  - Node.js + Express + MongoDB REST API backend
#
# To configure environment variables for local development or deployment,
# copy the respective `.env.example` file in each directory to `.env`:
#
# - client/.env.example -> client/.env
# - admin/.env.example  -> admin/.env
# - server/.env.example -> server/.env
#
# Never commit actual `.env` files containing database credentials or JWT secrets.
# ==============================================================================
